<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsection"><a href="#A2.SS7" title="In Appendix B Theoretical Results ‣ Generalization Bounds of Stochastic Gradient Descent in Homogeneous Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7 </span>Proofs for Section <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a>
