<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A2.SS7.SSS1" title="In B.7 Proofs for Section ‣ Appendix B Theoretical Results ‣ Generalization Bounds of Stochastic Gradient Descent in Homogeneous Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7.1 </span>Proof of Lemma <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_subsubsection"><a href="#A2.SS7.SSS2" title="In B.7 Proofs for Section ‣ Appendix B Theoretical Results ‣ Generalization Bounds of Stochastic Gradient Descent in Homogeneous Neural Networks" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">B.7.2 </span>Proof of Theorem <span class="ltx_ref"></span></span></a></li>
</ol></li>
